  "limits": [
    "Source-level GM-to-L1 logical loads; actual HBM misses and effective transfer speed are unknown.",
    "C8 reuses per-layer receiver maxima and scheduled starts up to each recorded endpoint. It grants full exposure, zero overhead and no loss of overlap. A later wave can start before client-side receipt.",
    "Ordinary estimates reuse own prompt lengths, the highest frozen prefill concentration and observed graph counts. No per-request receiver trace or representative workload frequency.",
    "Free delivery of the FP16 gate/up pair is granted only in the two combined cases. The free-all case is a sensitivity scenario, with no demonstrated multicast or free cross-core path. Scale consumption at GMM2 output remains.",
    "Changing expert placement, weights, work distribution or GMM2 tiling has no credited savings. Other activation dtypes, draft, sync removal and parallel rescheduling require independent estimates."
  ],
